## 🧠 AI & Machine Learning

The proposed system combines multiple AI components rather than relying on a single model.

### Predictive Models

Machine-learning models can analyze longitudinal health information to support risk prediction and early-warning systems.

### NLP & LLMs

Natural Language Processing and Large Language Models can be used to interpret:

* Patient questions
* Clinical notes
* Symptoms
* Medical documentation
* Unstructured health information

### Decision Rules

A rules engine can support structured recommendations such as:

* Medication-related alerts
* Vaccination reminders
* Guideline adherence
* Drug-dosing considerations

### Explainable AI

Because AI-generated recommendations may influence healthcare decisions, the architecture incorporates explainability techniques such as:

* SHAP
* LIME
* Attention-based explanations

The objective is to help clinicians understand which patient factors contributed to an AI recommendation.

