## 🏥 Potential Healthcare Applications

### Medication Reconciliation

Compare medication information from different sources to identify potential discrepancies.

### Pharmacogenomics Alerts

Use genetic information to identify potential drug–gene interactions and dosage considerations.

### Diagnostic Support

Analyze symptoms and available health information to assist clinicians with possible diagnoses and recommended investigations.

### Personalized Care Plans

Combine laboratory trends, medical history, genomic information, and other patient data to support individualized care planning.

### Pre-Visit Summaries

Generate structured summaries of relevant patient history to help clinicians prepare before consultations.

### Continuous Health Monitoring

Analyze patient-generated and wearable data to identify potentially significant changes over time.

