## 👨‍⚕️ Human-in-the-Loop

The system is designed around **human oversight**.

AI recommendations should not automatically replace clinical judgment.

For critical recommendations:

```text
Patient Data
     ↓
AI Analysis
     ↓
Recommendation
     ↓
Clinical Review
     ↓
Decision / Action
```

This approach is intended to reduce the risks associated with incorrect AI recommendations and maintain appropriate clinical accountability.

