## ⚠️ Risk & Mitigation

| Risk                        | Proposed Mitigation                                 |
| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| Data Breach                 | Encryption, MFA, IAM, security audits               |
| Incorrect AI Recommendation | Human-in-the-loop review and model validation       |
| Algorithmic Bias            | Diverse datasets and bias audits                    |
| Privacy Violations          | Data minimization, de-identification and consent    |
| Regulatory Non-Compliance   | Regulatory analysis and documentation               |
| Low User Trust              | Explainability and transparent AI communication     |
| Alert Fatigue               | Prioritized and actionable alerts                   |
| Integration Failure         | FHIR/SMART interoperability and fallback procedures |

